      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sometimes VRChat has service issues, what happens if you try again to connect? Skip all the other stuff.\n\nFor that reddit post the steps for that user to reproduce the issue are:\n\n1. Open VRChat\n\n2. It logs in automatically\n\n3. Instead of home world, get that error world\n\nThe flashing black screen part sounds most interesting out of everything you've written. I think you should look at the VRChat client logs. Not sure what for, but there might be something in there.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
