  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-08-24T02:51:42.026Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Open VRchat\n\n2. Get a flashing screen alternating between Vrchat and just a black monitor. (Approx. 3 flashes)\n\n3. Recreated on Desktop and VR headset\n\n4. Not a Eu user nor am i using a VPN\n\n5. Have tried tried changing region\n\n6. Cleared cache/cleared local app data, reinstalled, repaired registries, still same result\n\n7. Deleted all my personally uploaded avatars from unity\n\n8. Reset my Avatar to default on website\n\n9. Was on it a day ago and didn't have this issue\n\n10. looks the same as this user https://www.reddit.com/r/VRchat/comments/qbm66l/im_having_issues_with_vrchat/",
